We should, because when we come back, we're going to have a weather breakdown.
我们应该休息，因为回来后，我们要进行天气分析。

623
00:27:49.120 --> 00:27:50.320
A weather breakdown.
天气分析。

624
00:27:50.320 --> 00:27:51.300
I can't wait.
我等不及了。

625
00:28:01.880 --> 00:28:04.840
Well, we are back, and it is pouring rain.
好了，我们回来了，外面正下着倾盆大雨。

626
00:28:05.260 --> 00:28:11.960
There is a black screen with the words, Week 7, August 11th, and you can just hear the rain.
屏幕是黑色的，上面写着“第7周，8月11日”，你只能听到雨声。

