00:28:12.360 --> 00:28:13.900
Now it's time for the weigh-in.
现在是称重时间了。

628
00:28:14.000 --> 00:28:14.940
Everyone's in the warehouse.
大家都在仓库里。

629
00:28:15.200 --> 00:28:19.260
The huge warehouse door is open, and it's just coming down.
巨大的仓库门开着，雨正倾泻而下。

630
00:28:19.520 --> 00:28:19.820
Hmm.
嗯。

631
00:28:19.980 --> 00:28:21.420
I wonder why it needed to rain.
我想知道为什么非得下雨。

632
00:28:21.680 --> 00:28:25.220
I wonder why we needed to establish a big rainstorm, huh?
我想知道为什么我们需要设定一场大暴雨，嗯？

633
00:28:25.220 --> 00:28:25.940
I don't know why.
我不知道为什么。

634
00:28:26.020 --> 00:28:27.480
Maybe we'll find out in a little bit.
也许过一会儿我们就知道了。

635
00:28:27.680 --> 00:28:30.800
Well, this was fake rain, and yes, this was thought out.
嗯，这是人造雨，没错，这是经过深思熟虑的。

636
00:28:30.920 --> 00:28:37.080
They wanted to establish this big rainstorm outside of the windows of our set in the bullpen,
他们想在办公区场景的窗外营造出这场大暴雨，

637
00:28:37.080 --> 00:28:39.960
