那里通常会有巨大的背景幕，对吧，珍娜？

638
00:28:40.080 --> 00:28:40.260
Yep.
没错。

639
00:28:40.420 --> 00:28:43.080
They brought in those rain panels that you told us about.
他们搬来了你告诉过我们的那些雨幕装置。

640
00:28:43.340 --> 00:28:49.060
Oh, because we had an episode where Michael couldn't get the top up on his convertible,
噢，因为我们有一集是迈克尔没法把敞篷车的顶棚升起来，

641
00:28:49.060 --> 00:28:51.160
and then it rained inside the car.
然后车里就下雨了。

642
00:28:51.340 --> 00:28:52.020
That's right.
没错。

643
00:28:52.220 --> 00:28:58.000
So they brought back in those big window panes that they were able to sort of recycle water through
所以他们又搬回了那些大窗板，他们能让水在里面循环流动，

644
00:28:58.000 --> 00:29:02.200
so it looked like raining, and you're going to see it in the backdrop of several scenes
看起来就像在下雨，你会在好几个场景的背景中看到它，

645
00:29:02.200 --> 00:29:06.580
that just help keep reinforcing that it is a rainy day out.
这有助于不断强化外面是个雨天这一设定。

646
00:29:07.040 --> 00:29:12.080
The one thing I will tell you is that sometimes with this rain, like outside the warehouse,
有一件事我要告诉你，有时这种雨，比如在仓库外面，

647
00:29:12.400 --> 00:29:16.100
they would have to adjust that for the sound department and editing,
他们必须为音效部门和剪辑部门进行调整，

648
00:29:16.840 --> 00:29:18.440
but they said it sounded real.
但他们说听起来很真实。

649
00:29:18.440 --> 00:29:20.940
So the sound department didn't have to edit out the fake rain.
所以音效部门不需要把这些假雨声剪掉。

650
00:29:21.340 --> 00:29:21.680
Huh.
嗯。

651
00:29:22.240 --> 00:29:23.400
Well, there you go.
好了，就是这样。

652
00:29:23.940 --> 00:29:28.500
Also, if you're keeping track, remember Kelly Cantley in last week's episode gave us a list
另外，如果你有在留意的话，记得上周那集凯莉·坎特利给了我们一份清单，

653
00:29:28.500 --> 00:29:29.820
of things to keep track of.
上面列着需要留意的事情。

654
00:29:29.980 --> 00:29:34.200
We are now two guys no goatee, one guy goatee.
我们现在是两个人没留山羊胡，一个人留了山羊胡。

655
00:29:34.420 --> 00:29:37.640
Michael and Ryan no goatee, Dwight with a goatee.
迈克尔和瑞安没留，德怀特留了。

656
00:29:37.760 --> 00:29:38.340
That's right.
没错。

657
00:29:38.780 --> 00:29:44.280
They're also having their week seven weigh-in, and this is when Holly says she hasn't heard
他们也迎来了第七周的称重，这时霍莉说她已经有三天没收到

