00:29:44.280 --> 00:29:47.400
from her yoga teacher date in like three days.
她那个瑜伽教练约会对象的消息了。

659
00:29:47.600 --> 00:29:47.780
Yeah.
是啊。

660
00:29:47.780 --> 00:29:53.320
She had even bought tickets to the Counting Crows for that night, and she doesn't know.
她甚至买了那天晚上的“数乌鸦”乐队演唱会门票，但她不知道对方怎么想。

661
00:29:53.420 --> 00:29:54.340
Like, is he going to show?
比如，他会来吗？

662
00:29:54.560 --> 00:29:55.340
Is he going to call?
他会打电话吗？

663
00:29:55.700 --> 00:29:56.080
Yeah.
是啊。

664
00:29:56.980 --> 00:30:00.160
And Daryl announces that they've lost four pounds.
达里尔宣布他们减掉了四磅。

665
00:30:00.600 --> 00:30:01.220
Four pounds.
四磅。

666
00:30:01.600 --> 00:30:04.720
