00:30:11.920 --> 00:30:13.760
Jim says, why don't you meet me for lunch?
吉姆说，要不我们午餐见个面？

671
00:30:13.760 --> 00:30:15.000
Yeah, kind of spontaneous.
是啊，挺随性的。

672
00:30:15.240 --> 00:30:15.980
We'll meet in the middle.
我们在中间碰头。

673
00:30:16.180 --> 00:30:16.980
Yeah, meet halfway.
对，在半路碰头。

674
00:30:17.400 --> 00:30:20.980
