685
00:30:58.740 --> 00:31:01.300
Joya, and she sent it to me.
乔亚，她发给我了。

686
00:31:01.500 --> 00:31:02.840
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

687
00:31:02.940 --> 00:31:07.020
So I have Pam's ASCII portrait of Dwight.
所以我现在有帕姆画的德怀特ASCII肖像了。

688
00:31:07.200 --> 00:31:08.040
I'll put it in our stories.
我会把它发到我们的快拍里。

689
00:31:08.280 --> 00:31:09.480
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

690
00:31:09.800 --> 00:31:13.560
Well, I like it because it shows that Pam is learning things in school.
我喜欢它是因为这说明帕姆在学校里学到了东西。

691
00:31:13.740 --> 00:31:14.040
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

692
00:31:14.200 --> 00:31:15.540
She's not just flirting.
她不只是在调情。

693
00:31:16.220 --> 00:31:17.860
No, she's not, everyone.
不，大家，她不是。

694
00:31:18.220 --> 00:31:19.780
