她戴上紫色的花朵耳环，扎着马尾辫去上课了。

696
00:31:24.760 --> 00:31:32.760
Holly goes in to talk to Michael, and she wants him to know that they have lost to Utica by only eight pounds.
霍莉进去找迈克尔谈话，她想让他知道他们只输给尤蒂卡分部八磅。

697
00:31:33.260 --> 00:31:34.820
And Michael's like, wait a second.
迈克尔就说，等一下。

698
00:31:34.900 --> 00:31:36.620
We have to the end of the day.
我们还有到今天结束的时间。

699
00:31:37.500 --> 00:31:43.820
Maybe if they really go for it, they crank up the heat, they're going to wear trash bags, maybe they can get there.
也许如果他们真的拼一把，把暖气开大，穿上垃圾袋，说不定能追上。

700
00:31:44.040 --> 00:31:45.820
Well, Andy's into it immediately.
安迪立刻就上钩了。

701
00:31:45.860 --> 00:31:47.520
He puts on his trash bags.
他穿上了他的垃圾袋。

702
00:31:47.520 --> 00:31:49.420
