00:34:05.210 --> 00:34:09.730
Big Red Ultimate Outdoor Rugs, Marie Osmond Inspiration Bench.
大红终极户外地毯、玛丽·奥斯蒙德灵感长椅。

743
00:34:10.390 --> 00:34:12.930
Decorative wall hat, and Getty's calendar.
装饰性墙帽，还有盖蒂的日历。

744
00:34:13.650 --> 00:34:14.170
Wow.
哇。

745
00:34:14.470 --> 00:34:18.630
That's what was on their registry on the NBC.com wedding site.
这就是他们在NBC.com婚礼网站上登记的东西。

