00:34:19.330 --> 00:34:20.130
It's time.
时候到了。

747
00:34:20.490 --> 00:34:21.370
It's time.
时候到了。

748
00:34:21.770 --> 00:34:26.370
Jim and Pam, they're going to meet up at the rest stop in the pouring rain.
吉姆和帕姆，他们要在倾盆大雨中在休息站见面。

