755
00:34:41.050 --> 00:34:41.370
Yes.
是的。

756
00:34:41.670 --> 00:34:44.510
Jim gets down on one knee, and he proposes to Pam.
吉姆单膝跪地，向帕姆求婚。

757
00:34:44.690 --> 00:34:45.770
She's totally shocked.
她完全惊呆了。

758
00:34:45.950 --> 00:34:47.170
They're at a gas station.
他们当时在一个加油站。

759
00:34:47.850 --> 00:34:52.070
You know, he was supposed to wait till she got back from art school, but he says he couldn't
你知道，他本该等她从艺术学校回来再求婚的，但他说是他实在

760
00:34:52.070 --> 00:34:52.370
wait.
等不及了。

761
00:34:52.370 --> 00:34:54.150
She's completely thrown.
她完全不知所措。

762
00:34:54.410 --> 00:34:54.530
Yeah.
是啊。

