迈克尔就说，你知道吗？

916
00:43:07.410 --> 00:43:09.350
I'll buy the Counting Crows tickets from you.
我把你的“乌鸦合唱团”演唱会门票买下来吧。

917
00:43:09.770 --> 00:43:11.190
And she's like, really?
她就说，真的吗？

918
00:43:11.450 --> 00:43:15.510
Everybody thinks this is like going to lead to Michael offering to go with her.
大家都以为这会让迈克尔主动提出陪她一起去。

919
00:43:15.750 --> 00:43:17.780
I thought they were-
我以为他们会——

920
00:43:17.780 --> 00:43:18.260
No.
不。

921
00:43:18.780 --> 00:43:20.540
Michael rips up the tickets.
迈克尔把票撕了。

922
00:43:20.540 --> 00:43:22.060
Like, gallantly.
就像，很英勇地。

923
00:43:22.360 --> 00:43:23.960
Like, he's saving the day.
就像他在拯救世界一样。

924
00:43:24.180 --> 00:43:25.660
And she's confused.
她当时都懵了。

925
00:43:26.100 --> 00:43:28.220
We got some mail from Emily G.
我们收到了一封来自艾米丽·G的邮件。

926
00:43:28.480 --> 00:43:28.800
Okay.
好的。

927
00:43:28.920 --> 00:43:29.820
Here's what she said.
她是这么说的。

928
00:43:30.060 --> 00:43:34.520
Having worked at several concert venues, I wanted to let you know that if you lose or
“我在几家音乐会场馆工作过，我想告诉你们，如果你弄丢或

929
00:43:34.520 --> 00:43:39.560
damage your concert tickets, you can go to a venue's box office with your photo ID and
损坏了演唱会门票，你可以带着带照片的身份证件去场馆的售票处，

930
00:43:39.560 --> 00:43:41.440
someone will reprint them for you.
工作人员会为你重新打印。”

931
00:43:41.760 --> 00:43:42.280
Oh.
噢。

932
00:43:42.620 --> 00:43:45.180
She said, I hope Holly knew that was an option.
她说，希望霍莉当时知道还有这个选择。

933
00:43:45.500 --> 00:43:46.860
Oh, that's good to know.
噢，这倒是个好消息。

934
00:43:47.140 --> 00:43:47.460
Yeah.
是啊。

935
00:43:47.980 --> 00:43:49.500
It didn't seem like Holly knew.
看起来霍莉当时并不知道。

936
00:43:49.500 --> 00:43:51.140
No, I didn't know.
不，我当时确实不知道。

937
00:43:51.340 --> 00:43:52.460
Well, now we all know.
好吧，现在我们都知道了。

938
00:43:52.460 --> 00:43:53.180
Now we all know.
现在我们都知道了。

939
00:43:53.280 --> 00:43:54.040
Thank you, Emily.
谢谢你，艾米丽。

940
00:43:54.240 --> 00:43:54.480
Yeah.
是啊。

941
00:43:54.960 --> 00:44:01.760
In the end, Dunder Mifflin did not win the weight loss competition.
最终，邓德·米夫林公司没能赢得减肥比赛。

942
00:44:02.380 --> 00:44:04.100
Stanley lost seven pounds.
斯坦利减掉了七磅。

943
00:44:04.340 --> 00:44:04.760
Yeah.
是啊。

944
00:44:04.940 --> 00:44:07.140
He says he's going to take off five days anyway.
他说反正他都要请五天假。

945
00:44:07.440 --> 00:44:07.680
Yeah.
是啊。

946
00:44:08.080 --> 00:44:09.580
And now it's week eight.
现在已经是第八周了。

947
00:44:10.700 --> 00:44:14.200
Toby is on his fifth week in a hospital room in Costa Rica.
托比在哥斯达黎加的医院病房里待了五周了。

948
00:44:14.560 --> 00:44:15.600
Oh, poor Toby.
噢，可怜的托比。

949
00:44:15.600 --> 00:44:20.440
You guys remember Toby had his weird moment with Pam, so he moved to Costa Rica.
你们还记得托比和帕姆之间那段尴尬的时刻吧，所以他搬到了哥斯达黎加。

950
00:44:20.720 --> 00:44:24.200
And on like his first day, or day, was it like day three?
结果就在他去的第一天，还是第二天，是第三天吗？

951
00:44:24.460 --> 00:44:26.000
Day three, he went ziplining.
第三天，他去玩了高空滑索。

952
00:44:26.240 --> 00:44:27.580
And he broke his neck.
结果摔断了脖子。

953
00:44:27.800 --> 00:44:28.060
Yeah.
是啊。

954
00:44:28.360 --> 00:44:30.100
He hasn't even been to the beach.
他甚至还没去过海滩呢。

955
00:44:30.660 --> 00:44:33.460
Did you notice what was playing on the TV in the hospital room?
你注意到医院病房里的电视在放什么了吗？

956
00:44:33.620 --> 00:44:34.360
Yes, I did.
注意到了。

957
00:44:34.360 --> 00:44:37.660
It is the Hug It Out, bitch episode of Entourage.
那是《明星伙伴》里“拥抱一下吧，碧池”那一集。

958
00:44:38.260 --> 00:44:42.360
That is the episode of Entourage that Michael quotes in The Coup.
那就是迈克尔在《政变》那一集中引用的《明星伙伴》剧集。

959
00:44:42.640 --> 00:44:47.060
Well, I have a little location breakdown for you about Toby's hospital room.
好吧，关于托比的病房，我有个小小的取景地分析要告诉你。

960
00:44:47.200 --> 00:44:47.800
Give it to me.
快告诉我。

961
00:44:48.000 --> 00:44:50.000
It was also filmed at USC.
它也是在南加州大学拍摄的。

962
00:44:50.500 --> 00:44:51.020
Oh!
噢！

963
00:44:51.260 --> 00:44:51.580
Yeah.
是啊。

964
00:44:51.700 --> 00:44:56.580
While they were there filming Pam's Art School, they used the USC television stage building.
他们在那里拍摄帕姆艺术学校戏份时，用了南加州大学的电视摄影棚大楼。

965
00:44:56.740 --> 00:45:00.700
And USC asked if eight of their film students could intern and help that day.
南加州大学询问是否能让八名电影系学生那天去实习帮忙。

966
00:45:00.700 --> 00:45:05.640
They had interns in all of the different departments, and our crew said they did a phenomenal job.
他们在各个部门都安排了实习生，我们的剧组人员说他们表现得非常出色。

967
00:45:05.820 --> 00:45:07.260
That is so cool.
太酷了。

968
00:45:07.460 --> 00:45:07.800
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

969
00:45:08.300 --> 00:45:15.080
Before we go, I just want to give a shout out to whoever the guy is in the bed next to Toby.
在结束之前，我只想向托比隔壁床的那位仁兄致敬。

970
00:45:15.600 --> 00:45:17.280
He was a background performer.
他是一名背景演员。

971
00:45:17.540 --> 00:45:22.580
Angela, I tried so hard to figure out who this is because he is so funny.
安吉拉，我费了好大劲想找出他是谁，因为他太搞笑了。

972
00:45:22.580 --> 00:45:29.780
He just stares into the camera the whole time Toby is talking.
托比说话的时候，他全程盯着镜头看。

973
00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:31.220
It is so good.
简直太棒了。

974
00:45:31.480 --> 00:45:33.040
I watched it three times.
我看了三遍。

975
00:45:33.120 --> 00:45:39.320
I was like, how is this guy doing such a great job with no words?
我当时就在想，这家伙是怎么做到一言不发却表现得这么好的？

976
00:45:39.460 --> 00:45:40.520
I was so impressed.
我印象太深刻了。

977
00:45:40.660 --> 00:45:42.020
We couldn't figure out who he was.
我们没能查出他是谁。

978
00:45:42.140 --> 00:45:43.660
We reached out to several people.
我们联系了好几个人。

979
00:45:43.920 --> 00:45:44.380
Yes.
是的。

980
00:45:44.520 --> 00:45:46.500
And I checked everywhere you can check.
我查遍了所有能查的地方。

981
00:45:46.500 --> 00:45:48.360
He is uncredited in the episode.
他在这一集里没有演职员表署名。

982
00:45:49.220 --> 00:45:50.140
Phenomenal job.
表现太棒了。

983
00:45:50.360 --> 00:45:51.460
Way to crush it.
干得漂亮。

984
00:45:51.460 --> 00:45:54.700
But that was Weight Loss Part 2.
但那是《减肥（下）》的内容了。

985
00:45:55.140 --> 00:45:59.020
There's so many folks to thank for helping us get this episode out to you.
有太多人需要感谢，感谢他们帮助我们把这一集呈现给你们。

986
00:45:59.180 --> 00:46:04.700
First of all, our crew that participated in the DVD commentary, Randy Cordray, Michael Gallenberg,
首先是参与了DVD评论音轨的剧组成员：兰迪·科德雷、迈克尔·加伦伯格、

987
00:46:04.840 --> 00:46:10.320
Brian Whittle, Nick Carbone, Ben Patrick, Alicia Raycraft, Kelly Cantley, and Jake OuSt.
布莱恩·惠特尔、尼克·卡博内、本·帕特里克、艾丽西亚·雷克拉夫特、凯利·坎特利和杰克·奥斯特。

988
00:46:10.780 --> 00:46:11.340
Amazing.
太棒了。

989
00:46:11.620 --> 00:46:12.540
Best commentary.
最棒的评论音轨。

990
00:46:13.080 --> 00:46:16.200
Really such a good listen if you love behind-the-scenes information.
如果你喜欢幕后花絮，这真的很值得一听。

991
00:46:16.520 --> 00:46:19.560
And James O'Kerry for letting us bug you with questions.
还有詹姆斯·奥凯利，感谢你让我们用问题烦你。

992
00:46:19.560 --> 00:46:21.000
Yeah, we did.
是啊，我们确实烦他了。

993
00:46:21.100 --> 00:46:21.940
We did bug him.
我们确实烦他了。

994
00:46:22.060 --> 00:46:22.560
We did.
确实。

995
00:46:22.720 --> 00:46:30.060
And Joya Balfour, oh my gosh, I'm so excited to share all of that NBC.com website stuff about Angela and Andy.
还有乔亚·巴尔福，天哪，我太兴奋了，能分享那么多关于安吉拉和安迪的NBC官网内容。

996
00:46:30.260 --> 00:46:31.800
And then Greg Daniels.
还有格雷格·丹尼尔斯。

997
00:46:31.840 --> 00:46:32.120
Yes.
是的。

998
00:46:32.360 --> 00:46:32.820
Thank you.
谢谢你。

999
00:46:32.980 --> 00:46:35.640
And also Paul Feig for that audio clip.
还有保罗·费格提供的音频片段。

1000
00:46:35.820 --> 00:46:38.220
I promise not to bother you too much, Paul Feig.
我保证不会太打扰你的，保罗·费格。

1001
00:46:38.220 --> 00:46:40.380
Well, we probably will.
嗯，我们大概会吧。

1002
00:46:40.680 --> 00:46:41.320
I know.
我知道。

1003
00:46:41.420 --> 00:46:42.480
Why am I making that promise?
我为什么要做出那种承诺呢？

1004
00:46:42.660 --> 00:46:45.780
But we appreciate our cast and crew so much.
但我们非常感谢我们的演职人员。

1005
00:46:45.820 --> 00:46:47.600
We hope you enjoyed this one.
希望你们喜欢这一集。

1006
00:46:47.720 --> 00:46:49.620
And we are kicking off Season 5.
我们即将开启第五季。

1007
00:46:49.620 --> 00:46:51.160
We'll be back for more next week.
下周我们会带来更多精彩内容。

1008
00:46:51.260 --> 00:46:51.820
We sure will.
我们一定会回来的。

1009
00:46:56.140 --> 00:46:57.900
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

